WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:05,350
Mr. Shen, what you said has been conveyed word for word.

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:10,220
Inform the Jian family. If you want Jian Tong, there will be no Jian family.

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:15,670
I want the Jian family. From now on, there will be no Jian Tong in the Jian family.

4
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:23,840
Then contact the school to help sell all his student status and change his resume to a junior high school diploma.

5
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:29,350
Last but not least, we always talk about going to jail.

6
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:33,110
Kill someone to pay for his life and only let him live for three years

7
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:36,280
Why does the housekeeper think something is wrong?

8
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:39,870
No, Mr. Shen did the right thing

9
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:44,430
If it weren't for Mr. Jian Tong, the mistakes Jian Tong committed against Wei Ming would never have been punished.

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,500
Tong Jian is a member of Jian's family. There is nothing I can do against him.

11
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,560
thank you sir thank you sir

12
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:57,240
Next to the housekeeper, I will teach Jian Tong a lesson.

13
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:59,240
Not because Weiming is your daughter

14
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:03,250
It's because prestige is the woman I like

15
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:13,380
Big order: Either the Jian family will keep you, the family fortune will be regretted

16
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:15,380
Either abandon you and save the family

17
00:01:16,290 --> 00:01:18,290
Miss Jane, please come with us

18
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:24,680
I have never harmed my reputation

19
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:33,170
Who would have thought that underneath this beautiful face

20
00:01:33,170 --> 00:01:36,470
Hiding such a vicious heart

21
00:01:36,470 --> 00:01:38,470
I really never harmed my reputation

22
00:01:38,470 --> 00:01:47,210
There is no evidence. You can't just do this.

23
00:01:47,210 --> 00:01:49,710
So, Miss Jian Tongjian

24
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:53,210
Please enjoy prison life happily from now on.
